# Firebase Android config. Not a secret in the strict sense — it ships inside
# the APK — but this repo is public, and an API key sitting in a public repo
# gets scraped and probed whether or not it is meant to be private. Keep the
# file locally at android/app/google-services.json; without it the gradle
# build silently skips the Firebase plugin and push stops working.
android/app/google-services.json
